      "en": {
        "name": "PMG gas mask",
        "shortName": "PMG",
        "description": "The PMG (Russian: Противогаз Малогабаритный — \"Small mask\") is a Soviet-era mask issued to Soviet Officers, Paratroopers and Artillery crewmen that features a 40mm GOST thread for filter connection. The mask was produced in russia before Bulgaria and Hungary started cloning product of the mask, before being slowly phased out until 1992."
      }
    },
