      "en": {
        "name": "M45 VPU \"Land Warrior\" Protective gas mask",
        "shortName": "M45 VPU",
        "description": "The M45 Chemical-Biological Mask System was introduced in 1996. It was intended for USSOCOM Ground Forces and was considered for broader adoption, but its use was limited due to logistical and legal factors. The M45 has a silicone rubber facepiece and includes features like a drinking system and ports for components like microphones and voice emitters. Its plastic parts were ultrasonic welded."
      }
